====================================================
PROJECT OVERVIEW
================

CompliAI is an Autonomous Compliance Engineering Digital Twin for telecom systems.

The system converts telecom regulations into executable compliance validation workflows through a 7-agent orchestration pipeline.

Core flow:

Regulation
→ Intent Extraction
→ CCL Generation
→ Knowledge Graph Mapping
→ Probe Generation
→ Probe Execution
→ Evidence Collection
→ Validation
→ Explainability
→ Compliance Decision
→ Report Generation

The V1 prototype targets:

TRAI QoS latency compliance using simulated telecom data.

