====================================================
CRITICAL ARCHITECTURAL PRINCIPLES
=================================

1. AGENTS REASON
   Agents orchestrate workflows, interpret regulations, generate CCL, and manage reasoning.

2. PROBES EXECUTE
   Probes are deterministic runtime execution primitives.
   They collect evidence and normalize it.

3. VALIDATORS DECIDE
   Compliance verdicts for deterministic constraints MUST be code-driven, not LLM-driven.

4. XAI IS CROSS-CUTTING
   Every subsystem emits traceability and reasoning metadata.

5. CCL IS THE SEMANTIC CORE
   CCL is the intermediate representation layer between regulations and executable compliance validation.

